# QA-A-234 (#253): clang-tidy configuration for modules/common. Findings are counted per file by CI against a baseline.
Checks: '-*,bugprone-*,clang-analyzer-*,performance-*,-bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters'
# easily-swappable-parameters is off: the public C ABI fixes parameter order such as (width, height); it cannot be reordered.
CheckOptions:
  # A catch (...) that swallows an exception carries a comment with this marker and the reason.
  - key: bugprone-empty-catch.IgnoreCatchWithKeywords
    value: '@TODO;@FIXME;[no-throw-boundary]'
HeaderFilterRegex: 'modules[/\\](common|preprocess)[/\\]'
